{"sha": "40b240c9baa38c76af2cc37c6a3f47a7dde67e59447286dd8b3e3edc5baff942", "body": ["\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:12}", "(a) $\\tilde f \\in L^2$，且 $\\norm{\\tilde f}_2 = \\norm f_2$；", "由 \\cref{exo:b3:lp:6}（共轭指数 $p = q = 2$）", "可知 $A_f = f * \\tilde f$ 有界且一致连续，并有", "\\[", "A_f(x) = \\int f(y)\\,\\overline{f(y - x)}\\,\\dd y,", "\\qquad A_f(0) = \\norm f_2^2,", "\\qquad \\abs{A_f(x)} \\leq \\norm f_2\\,\\norm{f(\\cdot -", "x)}_2 = A_f(0)", "\\]", "由柯西--施瓦茨不等式。", "", "(b) 对 $f \\in L^1\\cap L^2$，$\\tilde f \\in L^1$ 同样成立，并由", "卷积定理给出 $\\widehat{A_f} = \\hat f\\,", "\\widehat{\\tilde f}$；计算得 $\\widehat{\\tilde f}(\\xi) =", "\\int\\overline{f(-x)}\\eu^{-\\iu\\xi x}\\dd x =", "\\overline{\\int f(u)\\eu^{-\\iu\\xi u}\\dd u} =", "\\overline{\\hat f(\\xi)}$：$\\widehat{A_f} = \\abs{\\hat f}^2", "\\geq 0$。", "", "(c) 当 $\\abs{\\hat f}^2 \\in L^1$ 时，反演公式可用于", "连续函数 $A_f$（其变换可积；", "\\cref{thm:b3:fouriertransform:inversion}）：", "\\[", "A_f(x) = \\frac1{2\\pi}\\int\\abs{\\hat f(\\xi)}^2", "\\eu^{\\iu x\\xi}\\,\\dd\\xi .", "\\]", "对 $f = \\mathbf 1_{\\intcc{-1/2}{1/2}}$，有 $\\hat f(\\xi) =", "\\frac{2\\sin(\\xi/2)}\\xi = \\frac{\\sin(\\xi/2)}{\\xi/2}$，并在", "$x = 0$ 处：", "\\[", "1 = \\norm f_2^2 = \\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_\\R", "\\Bigl(\\frac{\\sin(\\xi/2)}{\\xi/2}\\Bigr)^2\\dd\\xi", "= \\frac1{2\\pi}\\cdot2\\int_\\R\\Bigl(\\frac{\\sin u}u\\Bigr)^2\\dd u", "\\]", "（$\\xi = 2u$），即 $\\int_\\R\\bigl(\\frac{\\sin u}u\\bigr)^2\\dd", "u = \\pi$ --- 普朗歇雷尔最喜欢的积分，借助", "自相关求得。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b3:fouriertransform:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 对方程关于 $x$ 形式地作变换：", "$\\partial_t\\hat u(t,\\xi) = \\widehat{\\partial^2_{xx}u} =", "(\\iu\\xi)^2\\hat u = -\\xi^2\\hat u$，这是关于 $t$ 的常微分方程，对每个", "频率，解为 $\\hat u(t,\\xi) = \\eu^{-t\\xi^2}\\hat f(\\xi)$。由于", "$\\eu^{-t\\xi^2} = \\hat g_t$", "（\\cref{exo:b3:fouriertransform:4}），故此乘积为", "$g_t * f$ 的变换。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\abs{u(t,x)} \\leq \\norm f_\\infty\\int g_t = \\norm", "f_\\infty$：良定义。在 $[t_0, T]\\times[-A, A]$ 上，每个", "混合偏导数 $\\partial^m_t\\partial^n_xg_t(x - y)$ 是", "关于 $(x - y)$ 与 $t^{-1}$ 的多项式，乘以", "$\\eu^{-(x-y)^2/4t}$，当 $\\abs y \\geq 2A$ 时，以", "$C\\,(1 + y^2)^N\\eu^{-(\\abs y - A)^2/4T}$ 为界，是一个可积的", "与窗口内 $(t, x)$ 无关的控制函数（且", "当 $\\abs y \\leq 2A$ 时有界）：对积分号下的", "重复求导（\\cref{thm:b3:lebesgue:paramdiff}）可用：$u \\in", "\\mathcal C^\\infty(\\intoo0\\infty\\times\\R)$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 记 $g_t(x) = \\frac1{2\\sqrt{\\pi", "t}}\\eu^{-x^2/4t}$：", "\\[", "\\partial_tg_t = g_t\\Bigl(\\frac{x^2}{4t^2} - \\frac1{2t}\\Bigr)", "= \\partial^2_{xx}g_t", "\\]", "（对 $x$ 求两次导：$\\partial_xg_t = -\\frac", "x{2t}g_t$，$\\partial^2_{xx}g_t = \\bigl(\\frac{x^2}{4t^2} -", "\\frac1{2t}\\bigr)g_t$）。由第 2 问，导数可", "移入积分号下：$\\partial_tu = \\partial^2_{xx}u$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $u(t,x) - f(x) = \\int g_t(y)\\bigl(f(x - y) -", "f(x)\\bigr)\\dd y$。给定紧集 $K$ 与 $\\varepsilon$：", "由 $f$ 在 $K$ 的某邻域上一致连续，可得", "存在 $\\delta$，使得 $\\abs{f(x-y) - f(x)} < \\varepsilon$ 对 $x \\in", "K$，$\\abs y \\leq \\delta$；尾部的贡献 $\\leq 2\\norm", "f_\\infty\\int_{\\abs y > \\delta}g_t(y)\\dd y = 2\\norm", "f_\\infty\\,\\P$-质量在 $\\delta$ 之外，其值为", "$\\frac2{\\sqrt\\pi}\\int_{\\delta/2\\sqrt t}^\\infty\\eu^{-z^2}\\dd z", "\\to 0$，当 $t \\to 0$ 时。对 $f \\in L^p$：$\\norm{u(t) - f}_p \\leq", "\\int g_t(y)\\norm{\\tau_yf - f}_p\\dd y$（闵可夫斯基与琴生，参见", "\\cref{thm:b3:lp:regularization}），同样分段，利用", "\\cref{thm:b3:lp:density}(3)。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 瞬时光滑化即第 2 问：$u(t)$ 是", "$\\mathcal C^\\infty$（$t > 0$），且未用到 $f$ 的", "光滑性。对 $f = \\mathbf 1_{\\intoo0\\infty}$：", "\\[", "u(t, x) = \\int_0^\\infty g_t(x - y)\\dd y", "= \\frac1{\\sqrt\\pi}\\int_{-x/2\\sqrt t}^{\\infty}\\eu^{-z^2}\\dd z", "= \\frac12\\Bigl(1 +", "\\operatorname{erf}\\Bigl(\\frac{x}{2\\sqrt t}\\Bigr)\\Bigr),", "\\qquad \\operatorname{erf}(s) =", "\\frac2{\\sqrt\\pi}\\int_0^s\\eu^{-z^2}\\dd z :", "\\]", "光滑化阶跃，其过渡区以 $\\sqrt t$ 的量级变宽", "（$t_1 < t_2 < t_3$ 时的图像：越来越平缓的斜坡经过", "$(0, \\frac12)$）。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 被积函数 $g_t(x-y)f(y)$ 满足 $\\geq 0$，而", "核严格为正：$u(t,x) = 0$ 则必有 $f = 0$", "几乎处处。关于 $f$ 的单调性即积分的单调性。", "即便 $f = 0$ 在某区间上，$u(t, \\cdot) > 0$ 在该处", "对每个 $t > 0$ 均成立：热量以无穷大速度传播，", "（任何地方的正性都瞬时被各处感受到）。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 由托内利定理（$g_t(x-y)\\abs{f(y)}$ 在", "$\\R^2$ 上可积）：$\\int u(t,x)\\dd x = \\int f(y)\\bigl(\\int g_t(x -", "y)\\dd x\\bigr)\\dd y = \\int f$。", ""]}